St. Columba Parish Handbook (August 2025)

Welcome to St. Columba. This handbook explains how to register, how to request sacraments and how to reach the staff.

The parish office is open Monday through Friday from 9:00 am to 4:00 pm. The office is closed on holy days and federal holidays.

Registration forms are available in the narthex and at the office. Registered households receive offering envelopes by mail.

The director of religious education is Delphine Arkwright, who oversees classes for kindergarten through grade 8 and confirmation.

Food pantry donations may be left at the garage door behind the rectory during office hours.
